# The Steiner system S(5,8,24) certificate workspace

The 759 blocks below are the candidate octads of the large Witt design
`S(5,8,24)`: the 253 sets `heptad ∪ {23}` over the `S(4,7,23)` blocks of
the `M23` layer, followed by the 506 octads avoiding the new point `23`.
The data is generated by `scripts/build_m24.py` from the weight-8 words of
the extended binary Golay code `[24,12,8]` spanned by the parity-extended
heptads; it is not trusted: Lean checks the finite claims recorded here,
including the block-index certificates for all four generators.
-/

